      "text": "Let \\( W(t) = 5 \\cos{\\left(\\frac{t^{2}}{4} \\right)} - 1 \\). Using a calculator, find the average value of W on the interval \\( 0 \\le t \\le 4 \\). Show the setup for the calculation, and give the value correct to three decimal places.",
